@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Optional timing: commit and lost response
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

scale 1 as 170 pixels
concise "Client observation" as C
concise "Durable local result" as D
@0
C is Waiting
D is Absent
@1
D is Committed
@2
C is Uncertain
@3
C is Reconciling
@4
C is Confirmed
@5
note top of C
 Logical ticks only.
 No timeout / SLA selected.
end note

@enduml
